# Explicit on purpose, don't rely on BuildKit's undocumented .gitignore
# fallback behavior to keep these out of the build context. node_modules in
# particular MUST be excluded: it's built here for the HOST's libc (glibc on
# most dev machines); the "dev"/"build" stages run on node:20-alpine (musl)
# and need their own `npm ci` inside the container (see
# docker/robostore.Dockerfile's "deps" stage) - if the host's node_modules
# ever leaked into the image via COPY . ., native deps like esbuild's binary
# would silently mismatch and break Vite at runtime.
node_modules
dist
.git
.env
*.local
npm-debug.log*
